{"arguments":{"end_line":100,"path":"openspec/changes/archive/2026-04-03-command-menu-refactor/design.md","start_line":1},"at":"2026-11-05T13:43:46.516344+00:00","call_id":"call_G1Vxa3byz1vfTAWd7LFg4ZOs","event":"function_result","name":"read_file","result":{"anchor_sha":"6a8e0bc9d828f011623abb8c70eacbbb0b7d3d8e","content":"1: ## Overview\n2: \n3: Split 705-line CommandMenu into 3 files by responsibility.\n4: \n5: ## Architecture\n6: \n7: ```\n8: CommandMenu.tsx (orchestrator, ~200 lines)\n9:   ├── imports command-menu-items.ts (pure utility, ~230 lines)\n10:   │     └── buildMenuItems(params) → MenuSections\n11:   └── imports command-menu-parts.tsx (renderers, ~180 lines)\n12:         ├── MenuSection({ label, items, activeId, onSelect })\n13:         └── MenuItemRow({ item, isActive, onSelect })\n14: ```\n15: \n16: ## Extraction Plan\n17: \n18: ### 1. command-menu-items.ts\n19: - Move: `MenuItem`, `MenuSections`, `BuildMenuItemsParams` interfaces\n20: - Move: `buildMenuItems` function\n21: - Move: `DEFAULT_EFFORT_LEVELS` constant\n22: - Export all\n23: \n24: ### 2. command-menu-parts.tsx\n25: - Extract inline section rendering from CommandMenu render body\n26: - Each section (context, model, customize, tools, slash, settings, support) uses same pattern: header + items list\n27: - Extract `MenuItemRow` for individual item rendering (currently inline JSX in .map())\n28: \n29: ### 3. CommandMenu.tsx (keep)\n30: - State: filter, activeIndex, sections visibility\n31: - Keyboard: ArrowUp/Down/Enter/Escape/Tab\n32: - Filtering: merge sections → flat list → filter by query\n33: - Layout: container + filter input + scrollable sections\n34: \n35: ## Key constraint\n36: - **TDD**: extract buildMenuItems first with tests, then extract parts, verify existing CommandMenu tests pass throughout\n37: - **No behavior changes**: pure refactor, expect assertions don't change\n38: \n39: ## Files Changed\n40: \n41: | File | Change |\n42: |------|--------|\n43: | `CommandMenu.tsx` | Remove buildMenuItems + inline renderers, import from new files |\n44: | `command-menu-items.ts` | New: buildMenuItems utility |\n45: | `command-menu-parts.tsx` | New: MenuSection + MenuItemRow components |","content_truncated":false,"path":"openspec/changes/archive/2026-04-03-command-menu-refactor/design.md","repository":"recca0120/code-quest","returned_lines":[1,45],"sha256":"e407ce15c681a608f224b60978b4e48dd58eeb85208ce214d3f941b34c0f974b","status":"found","total_lines":45},"round":4}
